  <entry>
    <title>UPROPERTY / UFUNCTION 常用標記速查</title>
    <link href="https://sparta334.github.io/Spartan_UE_Blog/posts/ue-cpp/uproperty-cheatsheet/" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <id>https://sparta334.github.io/Spartan_UE_Blog/posts/ue-cpp/uproperty-cheatsheet/</id>
    <published>2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z</published>
    <updated>2026-10-13T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
    <summary>整理 UE C++ 裡最常用的 UPROPERTY 與 UFUNCTION 標記，以及 Blueprint 曝露時的差異。</summary>
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<section class="markdown-section"><h2 id="為什麼需要反射標記">為什麼需要反射標記<a class="anchor" href="https://sparta334.github.io/Spartan_UE_Blog/posts/ue-cpp/uproperty-cheatsheet/#%E7%82%BA%E4%BB%80%E9%BA%BC%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E5%8F%8D%E5%B0%84%E6%A8%99%E8%A8%98"><span class="anchor-icon" data-pagefind-ignore>#</span></a></h2><p>UE 的反射系統（UHT）會掃描 <code>UPROPERTY</code>、<code>UFUNCTION</code> 等巨集，產生序列化、GC、Blueprint 曝露所需的程式碼。沒加 <code>UPROPERTY</code> 的 <code>UObject*</code> 指標<strong>不會被 GC 追蹤</strong>，物件可能被回收而留下懸空指標。</p></section>
<section class="markdown-section"><h2 id="uproperty-常用組合">UPROPERTY 常用組合<a class="anchor" href="https://sparta334.github.io/Spartan_UE_Blog/posts/ue-cpp/uproperty-cheatsheet/#uproperty-%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E7%B5%84%E5%90%88"><span class="anchor-icon" data-pagefind-ignore>#</span></a></h2><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame has-title" data-language="cpp"><figcaption class="header"><span class="title">MyCharacter.h</span></figcaption><pre data-language="cpp"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">1</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">UCLASS</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">()</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">2</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">class</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">MYGAME_API</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">AMyCharacter</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> : </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">public</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">ACharacter</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">3</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">{</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">4</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent">  </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">GENERATED_BODY</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">()</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">5</div></div><div class="code">
</div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">6</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">public:</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">7</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6">  </span></span><span style="--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6">// 只能在 Class Defaults 編輯，Blueprint 可讀</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">8</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent">  </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">UPROPERTY</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">(EditDefaultsOnly, BlueprintReadOnly, Category </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">=</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF">"Combat"</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">)</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">9</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent">  </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">float</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> MaxHealth </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">=</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">100.</span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">f</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">;</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">10</div></div><div class="code">
</div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">11</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6">  </span></span><span style="--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6">// 場景中每個 Instance 可個別調整</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">12</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent">  </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">UPROPERTY</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">(</span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">EditInstanceOnly</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">, </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">Category</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">=</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF">"Combat"</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">)</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">13</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">  </span></span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">TObjectPtr</span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">&lt;</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">AActor</span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">&gt;</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> PatrolTarget;</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">14</div></div><div class="code">
</div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">15</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6">  </span></span><span style="--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6">// 執行期狀態，Blueprint 可讀寫，不出現在 Details 面板</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">16</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent">  </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">UPROPERTY</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">(</span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">Transient</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">, </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">BlueprintReadWrite</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">, </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">Category</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">=</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF">"State"</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">)</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">17</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent">  </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">bool</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> bIsStunned </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">=</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">false</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">;</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">18</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">};</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy-btn-icon"></div></figure></div><div class="table-wrapper">
































<table><thead><tr><th>標記</th><th>作用</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>EditAnywhere</code></td><td>Defaults 與 Instance 都能編輯</td></tr><tr><td><code>EditDefaultsOnly</code></td><td>只能在 Blueprint Class Defaults 編輯</td></tr><tr><td><code>VisibleAnywhere</code></td><td>只顯示、不可編輯（常用於 Component 指標）</td></tr><tr><td><code>BlueprintReadOnly</code> / <code>BlueprintReadWrite</code></td><td>Blueprint Graph 中的存取權限</td></tr><tr><td><code>Transient</code></td><td>不序列化，存檔與複製 Asset 時不保留</td></tr><tr><td><code>Replicated</code> / <code>ReplicatedUsing=OnRep_X</code></td><td>網路複製</td></tr></tbody></table></div><blockquote class="admonition bdm-tip"><div class="bdm-title">TIP</div><p>Component 指標通常用 <code>VisibleAnywhere, BlueprintReadOnly</code>：可以在 Details 調整 Component 內的屬性，但不會把指標本身換掉。</p></blockquote></section>
<section class="markdown-section"><h2 id="ufunction-常用組合">UFUNCTION 常用組合<a class="anchor" href="https://sparta334.github.io/Spartan_UE_Blog/posts/ue-cpp/uproperty-cheatsheet/#ufunction-%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E7%B5%84%E5%90%88"><span class="anchor-icon" data-pagefind-ignore>#</span></a></h2><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame" data-language="cpp"><figcaption class="header"></figcaption><pre data-language="cpp"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">1</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6">// Blueprint 可呼叫，有執行腳位</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">2</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">UFUNCTION</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">(BlueprintCallable, Category </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">=</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF">"Combat"</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">)</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">3</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">void</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">ApplyDamage</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">(</span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">float</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70">Amount</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">);</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">4</div></div><div class="code">
</div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">5</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6">// 純函式，無執行腳位，不應有副作用</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">6</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">UFUNCTION</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">(BlueprintPure, Category </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">=</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF">"Combat"</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">)</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">7</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">float</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">GetHealthPercent</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">() </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">const</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">;</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">8</div></div><div class="code">
</div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">9</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6">// C++ 宣告、Blueprint 實作</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">10</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">UFUNCTION</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">(BlueprintImplementableEvent)</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">11</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">void</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">OnDeath</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">();</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">12</div></div><div class="code">
</div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">13</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6">// C++ 提供預設實作，Blueprint 可覆寫（實作寫在 OnHit_Implementation）</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">14</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">UFUNCTION</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">(BlueprintNativeEvent)</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">15</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">void</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">OnHit</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">(</span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">const</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">FHitResult</span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">&amp;</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70">Hit</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">);</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy-btn-icon"></div></figure></div><blockquote class="admonition bdm-warning"><div class="bdm-title">WARNING</div><p><code>BlueprintNativeEvent</code> 的 C++ 實作函式名稱必須是 <code>函式名_Implementation</code>。呼叫時要呼叫原名稱（介面則用 <code>Execute_</code>），不要直接呼叫 <code>_Implementation</code>，否則會跳過 Blueprint 覆寫。</p></blockquote></section>]]></content>
    <author><name>Spartan</name></author>
    <category term="UE C++"/>
