  <entry>
    <title>GAS 入門：ASC 要放在 Pawn 還是 PlayerState？</title>
    <link href="https://sparta334.github.io/Spartan_UE_Blog/posts/gas/gas-setup-notes/" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <id>https://sparta334.github.io/Spartan_UE_Blog/posts/gas/gas-setup-notes/</id>
    <published>2026-10-12T00:00:00.000Z</published>
    <updated>2026-10-12T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
    <summary>Gameplay Ability System 初始化時最常遇到的選擇：AbilitySystemComponent 的擁有者放哪裡，以及 InitAbilityActorInfo 的呼叫時機。</summary>
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<section class="markdown-section"><h2 id="兩種放法比較">兩種放法比較<a class="anchor" href="https://sparta334.github.io/Spartan_UE_Blog/posts/gas/gas-setup-notes/#%E5%85%A9%E7%A8%AE%E6%94%BE%E6%B3%95%E6%AF%94%E8%BC%83"><span class="anchor-icon" data-pagefind-ignore>#</span></a></h2><div class="table-wrapper">
























<table><thead><tr><th></th><th>放在 Pawn</th><th>放在 PlayerState</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>角色死亡重生</td><td>Attribute、Effect 跟著 Pawn 消失</td><td>保留在 PlayerState</td></tr><tr><td>適合</td><td>AI 敵人、單機遊戲</td><td>玩家角色、多人遊戲</td></tr><tr><td>網路更新頻率</td><td>跟 Pawn 一樣</td><td>需要調高 PlayerState 的 <code>NetUpdateFrequency</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section class="markdown-section"><h2 id="放在-playerstate-時的初始化">放在 PlayerState 時的初始化<a class="anchor" href="https://sparta334.github.io/Spartan_UE_Blog/posts/gas/gas-setup-notes/#%E6%94%BE%E5%9C%A8-playerstate-%E6%99%82%E7%9A%84%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96"><span class="anchor-icon" data-pagefind-ignore>#</span></a></h2><p>Owner 是 PlayerState，Avatar 是 Pawn。Server 與 Client 要在不同時機呼叫 <code>InitAbilityActorInfo</code>：</p><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame has-title" data-language="cpp"><figcaption class="header"><span class="title">MyHeroCharacter.cpp</span></figcaption><pre data-language="cpp"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">1</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6">// Server：Controller 擁有 Pawn 時</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">2</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">void</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">AMyHeroCharacter</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">::</span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">PossessedBy</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">(</span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">AController</span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">*</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70">NewController</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">)</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">3</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">{</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">4</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent">  </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">Super</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">::</span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">PossessedBy</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">(NewController);</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">5</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent">  </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">InitAbilitySystem</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">();</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">6</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">}</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">7</div></div><div class="code">
</div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">8</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6">// Client：PlayerState 複製下來時</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">9</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">void</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">AMyHeroCharacter</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">::</span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">OnRep_PlayerState</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">()</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">10</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">{</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">11</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent">  </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">Super</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">::</span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">OnRep_PlayerState</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">();</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">12</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent">  </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">InitAbilitySystem</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">();</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">13</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">}</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">14</div></div><div class="code">
</div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">15</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">void</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">AMyHeroCharacter</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">::</span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">InitAbilitySystem</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">()</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">16</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">{</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">17</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">  </span></span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">AMyPlayerState</span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">*</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> PS </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">=</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">GetPlayerState</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">&lt;</span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">AMyPlayerState</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">&gt;();</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">18</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent">  </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">if</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> (</span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">!</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">PS) </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">return</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">;</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">19</div></div><div class="code">
</div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">20</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">  </span></span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">AbilitySystemComponent </span><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">=</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> PS-&gt;</span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">GetAbilitySystemComponent</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">();</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">21</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">  </span></span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">AbilitySystemComponent-&gt;</span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">InitAbilityActorInfo</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">(PS, </span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">this</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">);</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">22</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">}</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy-btn-icon"></div></figure></div><blockquote class="admonition bdm-note"><div class="bdm-title">NOTE</div><p>ASC 的 Replication Mode：玩家角色常用 <code>Mixed</code>，AI 用 <code>Minimal</code>。</p></blockquote></section>]]></content>
