    <title>如何新增一篇文章</title>
    <link href="https://sparta334.github.io/Spartan_UE_Blog/posts/template/how-to-write/" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <id>https://sparta334.github.io/Spartan_UE_Blog/posts/template/how-to-write/</id>
    <published>2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z</published>
    <updated>2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
    <summary>這個部落格的寫作說明：檔案放哪裡、frontmatter 欄位、程式碼區塊與提示框語法。</summary>
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<section class="markdown-section"><h2 id="檔案位置">檔案位置<a class="anchor" href="https://sparta334.github.io/Spartan_UE_Blog/posts/template/how-to-write/#%E6%AA%94%E6%A1%88%E4%BD%8D%E7%BD%AE"><span class="anchor-icon" data-pagefind-ignore>#</span></a></h2><p>每篇文章是一個 Markdown 檔，放在 <code>src/content/posts/</code> 底下。可以用資料夾分類，圖片也可以放在同一個資料夾：</p><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame" data-language="text"><figcaption class="header"></figcaption><pre data-language="text"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">1</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292e;--1:#e1e4e8">src/content/posts/</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">2</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292e;--1:#e1e4e8">├── ue-cpp/uproperty-cheatsheet.md</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">3</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292e;--1:#e1e4e8">├── gas/gas-setup-notes.md</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">4</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292e;--1:#e1e4e8">└── rendering/my-new-post/</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">5</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#24292e;--1:#e1e4e8">    </span></span><span style="--0:#24292e;--1:#e1e4e8">├── index.md</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">6</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent"><span style="--0:#24292e;--1:#e1e4e8">    </span></span><span style="--0:#24292e;--1:#e1e4e8">└── cover.webp</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy-btn-icon"></div></figure></div></section>
<section class="markdown-section"><h2 id="frontmatter">Frontmatter<a class="anchor" href="https://sparta334.github.io/Spartan_UE_Blog/posts/template/how-to-write/#frontmatter"><span class="anchor-icon" data-pagefind-ignore>#</span></a></h2><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame" data-language="yaml"><figcaption class="header"></figcaption><pre data-language="yaml"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">1</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">---</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">2</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#1E7734;--1:#85E89D">title</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">: </span><span style="--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF">"文章標題"</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">3</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#1E7734;--1:#85E89D">published</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">: </span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">2026-10-13</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">4</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#1E7734;--1:#85E89D">description</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">: </span><span style="--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF">"列表上顯示的摘要"</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">5</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#1E7734;--1:#85E89D">image</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">: </span><span style="--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF">"./cover.webp"</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">   </span><span style="--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6"># 封面，可省略</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">6</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#1E7734;--1:#85E89D">tags</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">: [</span><span style="--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF">UE5</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">, </span><span style="--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF">Rendering</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">]</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">7</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#1E7734;--1:#85E89D">category</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">: </span><span style="--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF">UE C++</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">        </span><span style="--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6"># 填專題名稱：UE C++ / GAS / 多人联机 / 工具开发</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">8</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#1E7734;--1:#85E89D">ueVersion</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">: </span><span style="--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF">"5.4"</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">        </span><span style="--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6"># 適用的 UE 版本，可省略</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">9</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#1E7734;--1:#85E89D">draft</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">: </span><span style="--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF">false</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">            </span><span style="--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6"># true 時不會發布</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">10</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">---</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy-btn-icon"></div></figure></div></section>
<section class="markdown-section"><h2 id="程式碼區塊">程式碼區塊<a class="anchor" href="https://sparta334.github.io/Spartan_UE_Blog/posts/template/how-to-write/#%E7%A8%8B%E5%BC%8F%E7%A2%BC%E5%8D%80%E5%A1%8A"><span class="anchor-icon" data-pagefind-ignore>#</span></a></h2><p>支援標題與行號標示：</p><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame has-title" data-language="cpp"><figcaption class="header"><span class="title">Example.cpp</span></figcaption><pre data-language="cpp"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">1</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583">void</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8"> </span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">AExample</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">::</span><span style="--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0">BeginPlay</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">()</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">2</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">{</span></div></div><div class="ec-line highlight mark"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">3</div></div><div class="code"><span class="indent">  </span><span style="--0:#613aa9;--1:#c4aaf3">Super</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">::</span><span style="--0:#613aa9;--1:#c4aaf3">BeginPlay</span><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">();</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">4</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">}</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy-btn-icon"></div></figure></div></section>
<section class="markdown-section"><h2 id="提示框">提示框<a class="anchor" href="https://sparta334.github.io/Spartan_UE_Blog/posts/template/how-to-write/#%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E6%A1%86"><span class="anchor-icon" data-pagefind-ignore>#</span></a></h2><div class="expressive-code"><figure class="frame" data-language="markdown"><figcaption class="header"></figcaption><pre data-language="markdown"><code><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">1</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">:::tip</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">2</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">小技巧</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">3</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">:::</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">4</div></div><div class="code">
</div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">5</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">:::warning</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">6</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">注意事項</span></div></div><div class="ec-line"><div class="gutter"><div class="ln" aria-hidden="true">7</div></div><div class="code"><span style="--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8">:::</span></div></div></code></pre><div class="copy-btn-icon"></div></figure></div><blockquote class="admonition bdm-tip"><div class="bdm-title">TIP</div><p>在本機執行 <code>pnpm dev</code>，存檔後瀏覽器會自動更新。</p></blockquote></section>]]></content>
